  "details": "Description\n\nOn the profiles of some of my friends, the Request Invite button will be greyed out, and hovering over it displays the tooltip \"Cannot request an invite:\" with nothing to say why it cannot invite.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nOpen VRChat, open someone's profile in the Quick Menu that is affected by this bug, and try to request an invite from them\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1912-ad3bf7dafa-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
